"Primary":["Database primary","The database instance accepting writes in this single-writer example. Its change log is replicated to other instances.","WRITE|Primary|Replication log"],
"DBReplica":["Database replica","An instance receiving changes from the primary. It can serve eligible reads and may be a failover candidate. Replication can lag.","Primary|Replica|READ"],
